  "REQ GET https://displayvideo.googleapis.com/v1/advertisers/7/campaigns?alt=json&fields=kind%2Cid&filter=s-filter&orderBy=s-orderby&pageSize=7&pageToken=s-nextpagetoken&prettyPrint=false",
