  "REQ GET https://displayvideo.googleapis.com/v1/advertisers/7/channels/7/sites?alt=json&fields=kind%2Cid&filter=s-filter&orderBy=s-orderby&pageSize=7&pageToken=s-pagetoken&partnerId=7&prettyPrint=false",
